//      //                       ignore deviations due to gaps between the Edges and their
//      //                       face.
//      // bug 603 modification - use eOperationType = SM_SO_SURFACE_PROJECTED_INTERSECT
//      //   XSect proj of Edge->Curve to m_cpSurface1 with SmCrvOnSurf representation
//      //   of pCurve using SmCrvOnSurf(m_cpSurface1, m_cpUVCurve1) (both must be NonNULL). 
//      //   Keep all solutions as XSects whose 3D variation between CrvOnSurf and 
//      //   Edge->Curve projected to m_cpSurface1 is less than the XSectTol3d.  This means
//      //   that IntersectEdges thinks that both curves are meant to
//      //   be on the face of the classification's associated surface.
//      // Previous implementation - missed some intersections (Bug 603)
//      //   Use nearest curve-edge distance to select a reasonable tolerance
//      //   for upcoming curve-curve intersection.
//      //   1. find guess point as nearest pt between edge and classification curve
//      //   2. when dist between curves is larger than tolerance -
//      //      increase dNewXSectTol3d and Edge tol to include these min dist points.
